Package: fmi
Title: Hierarchical Permutation Tests for Functional Measurement
        Invariance
Description: Provides a suite of functions to test for Functional
    Measurement Invariance (FMI) between two groups. Implements
    hierarchical permutation tests for configural, metric, and scalar
    invariance, adapting concepts from Multi-Group Confirmatory
    Factor Analysis (MGCFA) to functional data.
    Methods are based on concepts from: 
    Meredith, W. (1993) <doi:10.1007/BF02294825>,5
    Yao, F., Müller, H. G., & Wang, J. L. (2005) <doi:10.1198/016214504000001745>,
    and Lee, K. Y., & Li, L. (2022) <doi:10.1111/rssb.12471>.
